          "id": 2,
          "options": {
            "content": "**Purpose.** Health of the per-service Postgres databases and the Redis caches, from both the server side and the client side.\n\n**Use it when** the Service dashboard shows slow DB queries or pool waits, or a cache seems not to be helping.\n\n**How to read it**\n- Postgres: rollbacks, locks and any deadlock are errors. Client query p95 rising while transactions stay flat points to contention.\n- Redis: a falling hit ratio sends load back to Postgres. Memory near its limit causes evictions.\n\n**Background:** [USE method (best practices)](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/dashboards/build-dashboards/best-practices/) \u00b7 [Hierarchy of needs](https://grafana.com/docs/learning-hub/intro-to-grafana-cloud/00-intro/02-hierarchy-of-needs) \u00b7 [Microservice monitoring](https://www.sysdig.com/blog/microservice-monitoring)",
            "mode": "markdown"
          },
          "repeatDirection": "h",
          "title": "",
          "transparent": false,
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "id": 3,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Postgres",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "repeatDirection": "h",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (db) (pg_stat_database_numbackends{datname!~\"template0|template1|postgres\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{db}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Connections by db",
      "transparent": false,
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 11
      },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "repeatDirection": "h",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (db) (rate(pg_stat_database_xact_commit{datname!~\"template0|template1|postgres\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{db}} commit",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (db) (rate(pg_stat_database_xact_rollback{datname!~\"template0|template1|postgres\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{db}} rollback",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Transactions /s by db",
      "transparent": false,
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 11
      },
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "repeatDirection": "h",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (db) (pg_locks_count)",
          "legendFormat": "{{db}} locks",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (db) (increase(pg_stat_database_deadlocks[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{db}} deadlocks",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Locks + deadlocks",
      "transparent": false,
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Measured by the client, including network and pool time.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "links": [
            {
              "asDropdown": false,
              "icon": "",
              "includeVars": false,
              "keepTime": false,
              "tags": [],
